    "notes": "Compared to original 14169.png: olive scaly cockatrice, thick connected reptile tail, pale shaggy mane, red comb, ochre beak and existing clawed anatomy retained. Side/front/rear compass views are separate. Initial south contact incorrectly turned right; final edited south contact remains frontal with centered beak/chest, tail behind. All 104 poses are separated and RGBA-distinct, including locomotion, beak lunge, recoil and three connected collapse states. Production Main AI, contact, death and loot still need validation for each registered alias before counting."
